note Support page and CSS. Seeded Omega emits HTML on fd1 and CSS on fd4. The small header link is the only invitation; there is no banner.
text supage "<section class=\"support-page\" aria-labelledby=\"support-title\"><p class=\"support-kicker\">Keep open source moving</p><h1 id=\"support-title\">Help me keep building.</h1><p class=\"support-intro\">Everything here is free and open source, and it will stay that way. I'm one person building this, and I'm running low on funds. If you have extra to give to the open source community, you can help me keep going through X Money.</p><a class=\"support-button\" href=\"https://x.com/mdrakestapleton\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Support via X Money</a><h2>How to send support</h2><ol class=\"support-steps\"><li>Open X and select <strong>Money</strong>.</li><li>Choose <strong>Send Money</strong>.</li><li>Search for <strong>@mdrakestapleton</strong>, check the recipient, then choose the amount to send.</li></ol><p><strong>X Money is currently US-only.</strong> Sending money requires an X account with access to X Money. The button opens my X profile, not a payment checkout. Sending through X Money is peer-to-peer between X users, and X offers no public payment link I can put here.</p><p><a href=\"https://money.x.com/en/i/faq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read the X Money FAQ and eligibility requirements</a></p><p>If giving isn't an option, that's completely fine. Reading, trying the software, sharing a useful page or contributing a fix helps too. Nothing here is gated on a donation.</p><p><a href=\"/alpha/\">Try Sovereign Intelligence</a> · <a href=\"/contact/\">Get in touch</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/aien-dev\">Explore the source</a></p></section>\n"
text sucss ".support-page{max-width:48rem;margin:clamp(2rem,6vw,5rem) auto;padding:0 1.25rem;line-height:1.75;color:var(--text-primary,#f5f7fb)}.support-page h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.04em}.support-kicker{color:var(--accent-green,#00e599);font-family:var(--font-mono,ui-monospace,monospace);font-size:.8rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em}.support-intro{font-size:1.12rem;color:var(--text-secondary,#b8c1d1)}.support-button,.aien-support-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid var(--accent-green,#00e599);border-radius:999px;padding:.65rem 1.1rem;color:var(--text-primary,#f5f7fb);background:var(--bg-surface,#111722);font-weight:650;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}.support-button:hover,.aien-support-button:hover{background:var(--bg-card-hover,#1b2433)}.support-button:focus-visible,.aien-support-button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent-green,#00e599);outline-offset:4px}.aien-support-button{padding:.25rem .7rem;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;color:var(--text-secondary,#b8c1d1);background:transparent;border-color:var(--border-subtle,#2a3445)}.aien-support-button:hover{color:var(--text-primary,#f5f7fb);border-color:var(--accent-green,#00e599);background:transparent}.support-steps li{padding:.4rem 0}.support-page a:not(.support-button){color:var(--accent-blue,#7cc7ff);text-underline-offset:.2em}@media(max-width:600px){.support-page{overflow-wrap:anywhere}}\n"
fn main to int
n = write 1 supage 0 len supage
if ne n long len supage
ret 1
end
n = write 4 sucss 0 len sucss
if ne n long len sucss
ret 1
end
ret 0
end
